    <string name="stylus_service_description">To draw with S Pen while your fingers operate other apps, enable DrawAnywhere S Pen input in Accessibility settings (Android 14+), then turn off Finger drawing. It receives pen motion only while the canvas is active; it does not read screen content. Without this service, turning off Finger drawing passes all input through.</string>
