    <string name="stylus_service_ready">S Pen routing is ready. Turn off Finger drawing to send fingers to the app below and pen input to the canvas. Some systems interrupt the pen when a finger touches: test overlapping gestures on your device. The hand button switches all input to the app below.</string>
